  "Fifteen languages live in total: English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Persian, Bengali, Hindi.": "ᑕᓪᓕᒪᐅᔪᓂᒃ-ᖁᓕᑦ ᐅᖃᐅᓰᑦ ᒫᓐᓇᐅᔪᑦ ᑕᒪᐃᓂᐅᕗᖅ: ᖃᓪᓗᓈᑎᑐᑦ, ᑭᓇᑎᑐᑦ ᓯᕗᓪᓕᖅᐹᖅ, ᑭᓇᑎᑐᑦ ᒥᑭᓂᕈᓴᖅ, Japan-ᑎᑐᑦ, Korea-ᑎᑐᑦ, French-ᑎᑐᑦ, German-ᑎᑐᑦ, Spanish-ᑎᑐᑦ, Portuguese-ᑎᑐᑦ, Russian-ᑎᑐᑦ, Arabic-ᑎᑐᑦ, Turkish-ᑎᑐᑦ, Persian-ᑎᑐᑦ, Bengali-ᑎᑐᑦ, Hindi-ᑎᑐᑦ.",
